{"hw":"προσκαθίζω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">προσκαθίζω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">προσκαθ-ίζω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">sit down by</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">near</b>, c. acc. cogn., <span class=\"gk\">θᾶκον οὐκ εὐδαίμονα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hel.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">895</span> </span>: abs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">settle</b>, of gadflies or bees, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">31a</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">625a14</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Erx.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">397d</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Thphr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Vent.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">61</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">settle to the bottom of the vessel</b>, of a mixture, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aët.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.14</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Dsc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.40</span> </span>: metaph., <span class=\"gk\">τὸ φυσημάτιον προσεκάθισεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Epict.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.16.10</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">sit idle</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.167</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">sit down before</b> a town, <span class=\"gk\">προσκαθίσαντα πολιορκεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.12.4</span> </span>: abs., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">J.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AJ</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.8.5</span> </span>.</div></div>"}